From 2232f47df5274657f31d27d230d4356511d40e20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (SGR dev session)" <claude@sgr-dev.local>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 01:12:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(lint): B904 exception chaining + ruff autofixes (52 -> 22
 errors)

- Add 'raise ... from e'/'from None' to 13 except-blocks across
  api/routers/market.py, exchanges/ccxt_base.py, exchanges/pionex.py,
  saas/auth.py, saas/routers.py (B904) - preserves original traceback
  for debugging/audit trail per project's auditability requirement.
- Apply ruff --fix for 21 additional issues (mostly import sorting,
  minor style) across monitoring/*.py and alembic/versions/0001_initial.py.
- Manually restore alembic/env.py's side-effect-only model imports that
  ruff's autofix would have removed (F401 unused-import false positive:
  these imports register ORM models with Base.metadata for
  'alembic revision --autogenerate' and must not be dropped); added
  noqa: F401 with explanatory comment instead.
- No production behavior change. No mypy regression (118 errors,
  unchanged file set). Full suite verified green: 998 passed, 9 skipped,
  0 failed, coverage 86.08% (unchanged).
- Remaining 22 ruff errors are low-risk: E501 line-length (6),
  B017 blind-except-in-tests (4, standard pytest.raises(Exception)
  pattern), E402/B020/B018/B008 (1 each) - deferred, not addressed
  in this commit.
